sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as 用户
    participant V as Vue 页面
    participant A as Axios 拦截器
    participant I as AuthInterceptor
    participant C as RecipeController
    participant S as RecipeServiceImpl
    participant M as MyBatis-Plus Mapper
    participant D as MySQL

    U->>V: 填写菜谱标题、分类、食材、步骤
    V->>A: POST /api/recipe
    A->>A: 从 Pinia/localStorage 读取 token
    A->>I: Authorization: Bearer token
    I->>I: JwtUtil 解析并写入 UserContext
    I->>C: 放行请求
    C->>S: create(RecipeRequest)
    S->>M: insert recipe 主表
    M->>D: 写入 recipe
    S->>M: insert recipe_ingredient / recipe_step
    M->>D: 写入食材与步骤
    S->>S: detail(id) 组装 RecipeVO
    S-->>C: RecipeVO
    C-->>A: Result(200, data)
    A-->>V: 返回数据并跳转详情页
    V-->>U: 展示发布成功的菜谱
